<title>USA: Venture store operations executive quits.</title>
<headline>Venture store operations executive quits.</headline>
<dateline>O'FALLON, Mo. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venture Stores Inc said Thursday that Michael Hamilton, executive vice president of store operations, has left the company to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>It said Don Mielke, senior vice president of stores, will assume Hamilton's responsibilities and report to chairman Robert Wildrick.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
